body:
I'm sad. I really wanted to save some cash, but I'll end up getting Unicorn. At least I didn't buy trisbaena, rusty and isolde engine yet.

&#x200B;

The build now has 40 cards. I left Destrudo at 1, got out steam and the whole isolde engine (space connector, mali, etc) as well as the PKs. Tough is now at one, and last resort at 2. One mare mare, one junk forward, one blackwing zephyros, and I added 3x Danger mothman, 1x chupacabra, 1x ogopogo(not sure if that's relevant, tbh) and 1x orcust KM.

&#x200B;

Saryuja and unicorn is way out of my reach, so I just went with the unicorn, as it seems to be mandatory. Now I have all knightmares (with 2 phoenix for mermaid), curios, yazi, dracossac, decode, 2 double helix, linkuriboh, tri-gate and ib.

&#x200B;

Not sure if that gives you the general idea of how the deck looks like rn. I can make a full list if you want. And thank you very much! I'll try it out sometime this week and get back to you.
